<h3>Find where a game stores a value</h3><p>1. Pick what you know on the left, then press <b>Search</b> or <b>Take snapshot</b>.<br>2. Play until the value changes, then reopen this window.<br>3. Search again until only a few addresses remain.<br>4. Double-click an address to turn it into a cheat.</p>|<h3>查詢遊戲儲存某個數值的位置</h3><p>1. 在左側選擇你已知的資訊，然後點選<b>搜尋</b>或<b>拍攝快照</b>。<br>2. 繼續遊戲直到數值發生變化，然後重新開啟此視窗。<br>3. 再次搜尋，直到只剩下少數幾個位址。<br>4. 雙擊某個位址即可將其轉換為作弊碼。</p>
<h3>No address matches</h3><p>Try a larger tolerance, check the data size in <i>Advanced options</i>, or press <b>New search</b> to start over.</p>|<h3>沒有匹配的位址</h3><p>請嘗試更大的容差，檢查<i>進階選項</i>中的資料大小，或點選<b>新搜尋</b>重新開始。</p>
