General-purpose register R15.\nBy convention this doubles as the SH-2 hardware stack pointer (SP): the CPU pushes/pops it on exceptions and interrupts, and compiled code uses it the same way for the call stack.|通用暫存器 R15。\n按照慣例，它同時作為 SH-2 的硬體棧指標 (SP): CPU 在異常和中斷時對其壓棧/出棧，編譯後的程式碼也同樣將其用作呼叫棧。
General-purpose register.\nHolds data or an address; used freely by compiled code and by any SH-2 instruction that takes a register operand.|通用暫存器。\n儲存資料或位址；編譯後的程式碼以及任何帶暫存器運算元的 SH-2 指令都可以自由使用。
