Global Base Register (GBR).\nBase address used by GBR-relative addressing: MOV.B/W/L @(disp,GBR) and the @(R0,GBR) immediate forms of AND/OR/XOR/TST all compute their effective address from this register.|全域性基址暫存器 (GBR)。\nGBR 相對定址所用的基址: MOV.B/W/L @(disp,GBR) 以及 AND/OR/XOR/TST 的 @(R0,GBR) 立即數形式都從該暫存器計算有效位址。
