Procedure Register (PR).\nReturn address saved by BSR/BSRF/JSR; RTS jumps to whatever is stored here. The closest thing the SH-2 has to a hardware link register.|過程暫存器 (PR)。\n由 BSR/BSRF/JSR 儲存的返回位址；RTS 會跳轉到此處儲存的位址。這是 SH-2 上最接近硬體連結暫存器的東西。
Program Counter (PC).\nAddress of the instruction about to execute (delay slots are already accounted for). This is what a code breakpoint compares against.|程式計數器 (PC)。\n即將執行的指令位址 (已考慮延遲槽)。程式碼斷點就是與它進行比較。
