The Master SH2 is always running: it is the core the boot ROM starts first and, by default, the one with bus priority when both SH-2s access the same resource at once. Most games run the bulk of their logic here.|主 SH2 始終在執行: 它是啟動 ROM 首先啟動的核心，並且在兩個 SH-2 同時訪問同一資源時預設擁有匯流排優先權。大多數遊戲的主要邏輯都在這裡執行。
The Slave SH2 is idle until a game explicitly starts it (see the Sega Saturn Dual CPU User's Guide). Titles that use it typically offload a second, parallel workload here rather than running unrelated code to the Master SH2.|從 SH2 在遊戲明確啟動它之前一直處於空閒狀態 (參見 Sega Saturn Dual CPU User's Guide)。使用它的遊戲通常會把第二個並行任務放在這裡，而不是執行與主 SH2 無關的程式碼。
The audio device does not support 44.1 kHz stereo 16-bit output, so the slot cannot be previewed.|音訊裝置不支援 44.1 kHz 立體聲 16 位輸出，因此無法預覽該通道。
